[Header start]
! Eric and Deborahbot 5000 — a matched pair, doing their best.
!
! THE FIRST TWO-HANDER. It lives at the project root because it belongs
! to NEITHER character: every track carries a target, which is the whole
! reason a track has one. Two faces, two voices, one clock.
[Header end]

